Scope
-----

The MIT license above covers the source code of this site: the Astro
components, layouts, styles, build configuration, and page structure.

It does not cover:

  - The written content of the site — the prose on its pages, everything under
    src/content/, and the resume files in public/. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

  - The Atkinson Hyperlegible font files in src/assets/fonts/, which are the
    work of the Braille Institute of America and are redistributed under their
    own license terms, not this one.
